  "tagline": "A phone console that finds the server, keeps its credential encrypted, and puts one STOP on every screen.",
  "description": "HYDRA-UMC-ANDROID-CONTROL scans the local network for a HYDRA-UMC-SERVER, signs in with a token kept in the Android Keystore, sends small atomic commands over REST and listens to the state over a WebSocket, with Bluetooth LE as a second transport that no device answers yet.",
